      "note": "Spanish:  `las primeras 20 recetas donde su título incluye la búsqueda`\nToday:  Runs, on a place in memory.\nA (built, recommended):  `the first 20 recipes where its title includes the search`  --  the same words as `the first recipe`, plus a number.\nB:  `20 recipes where its title includes the search`  ·  `20 recetas donde su título incluye la búsqueda`  --  shorter, but which 20?\nC:  `the top 20 recipes where its title includes the search`  ·  `las mejores 20 recetas donde su título incluye la búsqueda`  --  everyday, but top by what?  `mejores` makes it worse.\nWhy:  Says which 20.\nRenaming it later:  3 lines in 3 files of rules, tests and docs, none in the built-in projects, none in your own projects.",
