      "note": "Spanish:  `el número de recetas donde su título incluye la búsqueda`\nToday:  Runs, on a place in memory.\nA (built, recommended):  `the number of recipes where its title includes the search`  --  Spell's word already:  `the number of its ingredients`.\nB:  `how many recipes where its title includes the search`  ·  `cuántas recetas donde su título incluye la búsqueda`  --  the spoken form, and reads as a question.\nC:  `the count of recipes where its title includes the search`  ·  `la cuenta de recetas donde su título incluye la búsqueda`  --  a programmer's word, and `la cuenta` is also the bill.\nWhy:  Reuses a word Spell has.\nRenaming it later:  58 lines in 29 files of rules, tests and docs, 16 lines in the built-in projects, none in your own projects.",
