      "note": "Spanish:  `cancelar búsqueda`\nToday:  Compiles;  an action's name now wins over an event of that word, in a handler too.  The engine under it is tested.\nA (built, recommended):  `cancel search`  --  the same word as `cancel process x`.\nB:  `stop search`  ·  `detener búsqueda`  --  plain, and `stop` is already a synonym for `cancel` on processes, so people may try it.  Doesn't parse today.\nC:  `cancel the search`  ·  `cancelar la búsqueda`  --  better English, and `the search` is the recipe box's own search text:  reads as a different thing.\nWhy:  The article stays out on purpose.\nRenaming it later:  3 lines in 2 files of rules, tests and docs, none in the built-in projects, none in your own projects.",
