      "note": "Spanish:  `- se deshace como \"Quitar receta\"`\nToday:  Runs, on a place in memory and on real servers.\nA (built, recommended):  `- undone as \"Remove Recipe\"`  --  an old word, and short.\nB:  `- it can be undone as \"Remove Recipe\"`  ·  `- se puede deshacer como \"Quitar receta\"`  --  a whole sentence, the way the epic's new lines are, and longer.\nC:  `- undo says \"Remove Recipe\"`  ·  `- deshacer dice \"Quitar receta\"`  --  says what the words are for:  the menu's label.  Nothing else in Spell reads like it.\nWhy:  Used all through the built-in projects, and not this epic's to change.\nRenaming it later:  20 lines in 13 files of rules, tests and docs, 3 lines in the built-in projects, none in your own projects.",
