      "note": "Spanish:  `publicar la receta`\nToday:  Compiles as an ordinary action.  It can't reach the place until the row above compiles;  the engine's `core.callPlace()` is there.  No built-in project has one.\nA (built, recommended):  `publish the recipe`  --  you chose this (Q14).  It adds no verb, and this device could do it too.\nB:  `send the recipe to the family cookbook`  ·  `enviar la receta al recetario familiar`  --  reads naturally, and says something travels, so the back-end shows through.  It needs events renamed to `tell`:  `tell the card flipped`.  `send` is used in 0 built-in projects, so it's cheap.\nWhy:  Decided, with renaming events still possible later.\nRenaming it later:  1 line in 1 file of rules, tests and docs, none in the built-in projects, none in your own projects.",
