      "note": "Spanish:  `cuando cambia una receta:`\nToday:  Still being built:  it used to compile, in English, to an event nobody sends;  on this branch it won't compile unless the type is saved.\nA (built, recommended):  `when a recipe changes:`  --  the same as `when its title changes:`.\nB:  `whenever a recipe changes:`  ·  `cada vez que cambia una receta:`  --  says it happens more than once.  Spell's other event words don't.\nC:  `when any recipe changes:`  ·  `cuando cambia cualquier receta:`  --  exact, and a word Spell has nowhere else.  TRAP:  it compiles today, in English, to an event nobody sends.\nWhy:  `is added` and `is removed` were proposed too, and aren't being built.\nRenaming it later:  20 lines in 12 files of rules, tests and docs, 1 line in the built-in projects, none in your own projects.",
